lca_irqstub_probe -- binary=/tmp/gxlca/gxemul label=fix machine=alphabook1
row            got          want         note                                                         
live           alive        alive        CONTROL: a free-running self-branch alone must survive       ok
ram ctl        alive        alive        ATTRIBUTION: the IDENTICAL sequence against RAM must survive ok
uart irq       alive        alive        an ordinary UART interrupt must not end the emulator         ok
stub named     no           no           the stub's own TODO diagnostic must not appear               ok
irq latched    1            1            bounded: a free-running tick re-asserts, and it must still print ONCE ok

IRQSTUB_RESULT=5/5
IRQSTUB_DONE
